# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# This replaces the GitHub Pages 404.html redirect hack. Pages serves a real
# static file when one exists, so the per-product pages that scripts/create-static-routes.js
# generates (/products/granola/index.html and friends) are still served as themselves,
# with their own title, canonical and Product JSON-LD. Only paths with no file
# fall through to the React app.
#
# 200 means rewrite, not redirect: the URL the visitor sees does not change,
# which is what react-router needs to pick up the route.
/*    /index.html   200
